### ==========================================
### WATCHLIST ROUTES (/user-api)
### Replace <USER_ID> and <STOCK_ID> with actuals
### Login as TRADER first
### ==========================================

### Get user's watchlist
GET http://localhost:5000/user-api/watchlist/<USER_ID>

### Add stock to watchlist
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/watchlist/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "<USER_ID>",
    "stockId": "<STOCK_ID>"
}

### Add another stock to watchlist
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/watchlist/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "<USER_ID>",
    "stockId": "<STOCK_ID_2>"
}

### --- ERROR: Add duplicate to watchlist ---
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/watchlist/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "<USER_ID>",
    "stockId": "<STOCK_ID>"
}

### Remove stock from watchlist
DELETE http://localhost:5000/user-api/watchlist/remove/<USER_ID>/<STOCK_ID>

### Get watchlist again (verify removal)
GET http://localhost:5000/user-api/watchlist/<USER_ID>
